1. Document Purpose / 文件目的
This document provides standard knowledge for the INC Message Builder agent to collect incident information, check completeness, and generate bilingual INC messages for Central Control.
本文件提供 INC Message Builder 使用的標準知識，協助保安及營運同事收集事故資料、檢查資料完整性，並產生中英文雙語 INC message，供 Central Control 建立新的 INC ticket。
The agent should use this document to:
•	Collect the 12 required INC details
•	Ask missing information one item at a time
•	Use standard English and Traditional Chinese wording
•	Produce a copy-ready bilingual INC message
•	Avoid guessing unconfirmed information
________________________________________
2. General INC Message Principles / INC Message 基本原則
Each INC message must follow these principles:
1.	Use a clear, concise, and professional tone.
2.	Provide both English Version and 中文版本.
3.	Keep site names, tower names, floor names, device numbers, vendor names, staff names, and department names unchanged.
4.  If Point 4 "Incident" is not following the rules of "Category" - "Site" - "Device Number" - Short Description", plesae ask the user to confirm before final output.
5.	Do not assume information that has not been provided.
6.	If information is unavailable, ask user to provide.
7.	Date and time should use the format DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM.
8.	The incident description should be short, direct, and operationally clear.
________________________________________
3. 12-Point INC Checklist / 12項 INC 必填資料
No.	English Field	中文欄位	Required	Format / Guidance
1	Required to Inform Customer	是否需要通知客戶	Yes	Yes / No；是 / 否
2	Date/Time of Occurrence	發生日期／時間	Yes	DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM
3	Location / Tower / Floor	地點／大樓／樓層	Yes	Site - Floor
4	Incident	事故	Yes	Category - Site - Device Number - Short Description
5	Customer / Informant	客戶／通報人	Yes	Who reported this issue
6	Impact	影響	Yes	Customer impact and other impact
7	Current Status / Action Taken	目前狀態／已採取行動	Yes	Checked, informed, arranged, isolated, monitored, etc.
8	Vendor Estimated Time of Arrival	供應商預計到達時間	ETA, TBC
9	Vendor Company Name	供應商公司名稱	Conditional	Vendor name or N/A
10	Category	類別	Yes	Security, Property, E&M, TD
11	Person in Charge	負責人	Yes	Incident lead staff name
12	Person in Charge Department	負責人部門	Yes	Lead’s team or department
________________________________________
4. Standard Question Set / 標準提問方式
The agent should ask the following questions one by one.
1. Required to Inform Customer / 是否需要通知客戶
English: Is customer notification required? Please answer Yes or No.
中文： 是否需要通知客戶？請回答「是」或「否」。
2. Date/Time of Occurrence / 發生日期／時間
English: What is the date and time of occurrence? Please use DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM.
中文： 事故發生日期及時間是甚麼？請使用 DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM 格式。
3. Location / Tower / Floor / 地點／大樓／樓層
English: What is the location, tower, and floor?
中文： 事故地點、大樓及樓層是甚麼？
4. Incident / 事故
English: What happened? Please provide the sub-category, site, device number, and a short description.
中文： 發生了甚麼事故？請提供子類別、地點、設備編號及簡短描述。
5. Customer / Informant / 客戶／通報人
English: Which team or person discovered or reported the issue?
中文： 哪個團隊或人士發現或通報問題？
6. Impact / 影響
English: What is the customer impact and any other impact?
中文： 對客戶有甚麼影響？是否有其他影響？
7. Current Status / Action Taken / 目前狀態／已採取行動
English: What action has been taken so far?
中文： 目前已採取甚麼行動？
8. Vendor ETA / 供應商預計到達時間
English: What is the vendor estimated time of arrival?
中文： 供應商預計到達時間是甚麼？
9. Vendor Company Name / 供應商公司名稱
English: What is the vendor company name?
中文： 供應商公司名稱是甚麼？
10. Category / 類別
English: Which department should lead this incident?
中文： 此事故應由哪個部門負責跟進？
11. Person in Charge / 負責人
English: Who is the person in charge?
中文： 負責人是誰？
12. Person in Charge Department / 負責人部門
English: Which team or department does the person in charge belong to?
中文： 負責人屬於哪個團隊或部門？
________________________________________
5. Category Reference / 類別參考
Incident Type	Suggested Category	Notes
Lift fault	Engineering	Include lift number and affected floor
Air-conditioning issue	Engineering	Include affected area and temperature impact if available
Access control issue	Security / Engineering	Include door number, card reader, or affected access point
CCTV issue	Security / Engineering	Include camera number and affected view
Fire alarm / fire panel issue	Engineering / Safety	Include alarm location and panel status
Water leakage	Engineering	Include source, affected area, and containment action
Power failure	Engineering	Include affected equipment or area
Network / system issue	IT	Include system name and user impact
Cleaning / hygiene issue	Facilities / Cleaning	Include location and urgency
Suspicious person / security incident	Security	Include location, description, and action taken
________________________________________
6. Standard Wording Library / 標準用語庫
6.1 Customer Impact / 客戶影響
Situation	English Wording	中文寫法
No customer impact	No customer impact reported at this moment.	暫時未收到客戶受影響報告。
Access affected	Customer access is affected.	客戶出入受到影響。
Service affected	Service is affected.	服務受到影響。
Partial impact	Partial area is affected.	部分範圍受到影響。
Under checking	Impact is under checking.	影響情況仍在確認中。
6.2 Action Taken / 已採取行動
Situation	English Wording	中文寫法
Site checked	Security team checked the area.	保安團隊已檢查現場。
Vendor contacted	Vendor has been contacted for follow-up.	已聯絡供應商跟進。
Warning notice placed	Warning notice has been placed on site.	現場已放置提示告示。
Area cordoned	Affected area has been cordoned off.	受影響範圍已圍封。
Monitoring	Security team will continue to monitor the situation.	保安團隊會繼續監察情況。
6.3 Vendor ETA / 供應商 ETA
Situation	English Wording	中文寫法
ETA confirmed	Vendor ETA is DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM.	供應商預計到達時間為 DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM。
Waiting for ETA	Vendor ETA is pending.	供應商預計到達時間待確認。
Vendor not required	Vendor attendance is not required at this stage.	現階段無需供應商到場。
________________________________________
7. Final INC Message Template / 最終 INC Message 範本
English Version
Please Create a New INC for <<Site Name>>

1. Required to Inform Customer: <<Yes/No>>
2. Date/Time of Occurrence: <<DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM>>
3. Location / Tower / Floor: <<Site - Tower - Floor>>
4. Incident: <<Sub-category>> - <<Site>> - <<Device Number>> - <<Short Description>>
5. Customer / Informant: <<Team or person who discovered/reported the issue>>
6. Impact: <<Customer impact>>, <<Other impact>>
7. Current Status / Action Taken: <<Action taken>>
8. Vendor Estimated Time of Arrival: <<Vendor ETA>>
9. Vendor Company Name: <<Vendor name>>
10. Category: <<Responsible department>>
11. Person in Charge (Staff Name): <<PIC name>>
12. Person in Charge (Staff Department): <<PIC department>>

中文版本
請為 <<Site Name>> 建立新的 INC

1. 是否需要通知客戶：<<是/否>>
2. 發生日期／時間：<<DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM>>
3. 地點／大樓／樓層：<<Site - Tower - Floor>>
4. 事故：<<Sub-category>> - <<Site>> - <<Device Number>> - <<簡短描述>>
5. 客戶／通報人：<<發現或通報問題的團隊／人士>>
6. 影響：<<客戶影響>>，<<其他影響>>
7. 目前狀態／已採取行動：<<已採取行動>>
8. 供應商預計到達時間：<<Vendor ETA>>
9. 供應商公司名稱：<<Vendor name>>
10. 類別：<<負責部門>>
11. 負責人（職員姓名）：<<PIC name>>
12. 負責人（職員部門）：<<PIC department>>
________________________________________
8. Sample Case: Lift Fault / 範例：升降機故障
English Version
Please Create a New INC for ABC Tower

1. Required to Inform Customer: Yes
2. Date/Time of Occurrence: 12-08-2026 08:35
3. Location / Tower / Floor: ABC Tower - Tower 1 - G/F
4. Incident: Lift - ABC Tower - Lift L3 - Lift stopped at G/F and cannot operate normally
5. Customer / Informant: Security Team
6. Impact: Customer access is affected, tenants need to use other lifts
7. Current Status / Action Taken: Security team checked the area, warning notice placed, vendor contacted for urgent attendance
8. Vendor Estimated Time of Arrival: 12-08-2026 09:30
9. Vendor Company Name: OTIS
10. Category: Engineering
11. Person in Charge (Staff Name): Kenny Fong
12. Person in Charge (Staff Department): ABC Tower Security

中文版本
請為 ABC Tower 建立新的 INC

1. 是否需要通知客戶：是
2. 發生日期／時間：12-08-2026 08:35
3. 地點／大樓／樓層：ABC Tower - Tower 1 - G/F
4. 事故：Lift - ABC Tower - Lift L3 - 升降機停在地下，未能正常運作
5. 客戶／通報人：保安團隊
6. 影響：客戶出入受到影響，租戶需要使用其他升降機
7. 目前狀態／已採取行動：保安團隊已檢查現場，已放置提示告示，並已聯絡供應商緊急到場
8. 供應商預計到達時間：12-08-2026 09:30
9. 供應商公司名稱：OTIS
10. 類別：Engineering
11. 負責人（職員姓名）：Kenny Fong
12. 負責人（職員部門）：ABC Tower Security
`
________________________________________
9. Missing Information Handling / 缺漏資料處理
Missing Item	Agent Response
Missing date/time	Ask user to provide date/time in DD-MM-YYYY HH:MM format.
Missing location	Ask for site, tower, floor, or affected area.
Missing device number	Ask for device number; if unavailable, confirm whether to mark as TBC.
Missing impact	Ask whether customer or operation is affected.
Missing vendor ETA	Ask whether vendor has been contacted and whether ETA is available.
Missing PIC	Ask who will be responsible for follow-up.
________________________________________
10. Quality Check Rules / 質素檢查規則
Before producing the final INC message, the agent should check:
1.	Are all 12 points included?
2.	Is the date/time in correct format?
3.	Is the location specific enough?
4.	Is the incident description short but clear?
5.	Is customer impact stated?
6.	Is action taken stated?
7.	Is vendor information completed or marked as TBC, Pending, or N/A?
8.	Is the responsible department stated?
9.	Are English and Chinese versions consistent?
10.	Are proper nouns preserved correctly?
________________________________________
11. Terms and Translation Guide / 術語及翻譯參考
English Term	Traditional Chinese
Incident	事故
Customer impact	客戶影響
Current status	目前狀態
Action taken	已採取行動
Vendor ETA	供應商預計到達時間
Person in Charge	負責人
Security Team	保安團隊
Engineering	工程部
Central Control	中央控制室
Access Control	門禁系統
CCTV	閉路電視
Fire Alarm	火警鐘
Lift	升降機
________________________________________
12. Do Not Guess Rule / 不可推測規則
The agent must not guess the following information:
•	Customer impact
•	Vendor ETA
•	Vendor company name
•	PIC name
•	Responsible department
•	Exact device number
•	Whether customer notification is required
If uncertain, the agent should ask a focused follow-up question or use TBC, Pending, or N/A after user confirmation.
